; Examples
:* {{Tlx|dir}}, for the current user language which is {{#language:{{uselang}}|en}} (<span lang="{{uselang}}" dir="{{dir|{{uselang}}}}">{{#language:{{uselang}}}}</span>), returns <code>{{dir}}</code>.
